  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145670",
      "title": "Introducing \"getStaticPaths\" For Dynamic Pages",
      "lectureOrder": 275,
      "videoOrder": 256,
      "sourceHash": "bac8871d6209a13b81def089b7c1f2ce64a3a6e50c0b9d082e55c8d16fe985ce",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 4.67,
          "en": "So what's up with this error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.67,
          "end": 9.01,
          "en": "Now good thing is this error actually tells us the solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.01,
          "end": 11.54,
          "en": "though of course, we don't really understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.54,
          "end": 14.21,
          "en": "why we need that solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.21,
          "end": 17.8,
          "en": "Well, keep in mind that currently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.8,
          "end": 21.29,
          "en": "Next.js is pre-generating all the pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.29,
          "end": 25.91,
          "en": "And I mentioned that it would pre-generate pages by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.91,
          "end": 29.29,
          "en": "It turns out this is not the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.29,
          "end": 32.4,
          "en": "if you have a dynamic page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.4,
          "end": 36.5,
          "en": "so where the name of the component has such square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.5,
          "end": 40.15,
          "en": "If you have a dynamic segment leading to that page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.15,
          "end": 41.54,
          "en": "if you have that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.54,
          "end": 45.87,
          "en": "the default behavior is not to pre-generate the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.87,
          "end": 48.07,
          "en": "And why is that not the default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.07,
          "end": 50.79,
          "en": "because keep in mind that technically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.79,
          "end": 55.04,
          "en": "for a this page, we won't just have one page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.04,
          "end": 58.45,
          "en": "but multiple pages for different IDs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.45,
          "end": 61.3,
          "en": "we have technically different pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.3,
          "end": 63.74,
          "en": "which have kind of the same frame",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.74,
          "end": 67.15,
          "en": "and the same general HTML content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.15,
          "end": 69.41,
          "en": "but different data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.41,
          "end": 74.41,
          "en": "This page can be loaded /P1/P2/P1000.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.86,
          "end": 79.12,
          "en": "So Next.js doesn't know in advance,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.12,
          "end": 82.32,
          "en": "how many pages it needs to pre-generate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.32,
          "end": 84.19,
          "en": "for this dynamic page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.19,
          "end": 87.63,
          "en": "It doesn't know which values for PID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.63,
          "end": 90.35,
          "en": "will eventually be supported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.35,
          "end": 92.44,
          "en": "And because it doesn't know that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.44,
          "end": 97.05,
          "en": "dynamic pages like this are not pre-generated by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.05,
          "end": 99.7,
          "en": "instead they are always generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.7,
          "end": 102.28999999999999,
          "en": "just in time on the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.28999999999999,
          "end": 104.13,
          "en": "Which is why it worked before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.13,
          "end": 106.00999999999999,
          "en": "But it's now not working anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.00999999999999,
          "end": 108.69,
          "en": "because we added get static props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.69,
          "end": 110.06,
          "en": "And as I mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.06,
          "end": 114.49000000000001,
          "en": "when you add this function to a page component file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.49000000000001,
          "end": 118.92,
          "en": "then you tell Next.js that you want to pre-render",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.92,
          "end": 121.97,
          "en": "this page in advance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.97,
          "end": 124.9,
          "en": "For index.js that didn't make a difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.9,
          "end": 127,
          "en": "there it was default anyways,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127,
          "end": 129.9,
          "en": "but for this dynamic page it does make a difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.9,
          "end": 132.95,
          "en": "because they it was not the default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.95,
          "end": 134.5,
          "en": "for the reasons mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.5,
          "end": 139.5,
          "en": "Next.js has no chance of knowing how many pages you need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.52,
          "end": 143.493,
          "en": "and which concrete values of this dynamic segment you need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 147.16,
          "en": "That's why for such dynamic routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.16,
          "end": 151.43,
          "en": "we need to give Next.js more information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.43,
          "end": 155.27,
          "en": "We can also tell Next.js which paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.27,
          "end": 158.62,
          "en": "So which instances off a dynamic page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.62,
          "end": 161.24,
          "en": "should be pre-generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.24,
          "end": 163.71,
          "en": "Because here we don't just need data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.71,
          "end": 167.8,
          "en": "we also need to let Next.js know which ID values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.8,
          "end": 171.6,
          "en": "which dynamic segment values will be available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.6,
          "end": 175.76,
          "en": "and for which values a page should be pre-generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.76,
          "end": 180,
          "en": "So that multiple instances of that page blueprint",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180,
          "end": 184.03,
          "en": "can be pre-generated by Next.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.03,
          "end": 188.32,
          "en": "And we do inform Next.js about this with another function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.32,
          "end": 190.27,
          "en": "we can add on the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.27,
          "end": 193.57,
          "en": "So another function we can add in this page file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.57,
          "end": 197,
          "en": "and that's the getStaticPaths function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 197,
          "end": 199.2,
          "en": "which also is a async.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 199.2,
          "end": 201.94,
          "en": "So where you can also use the await keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.94,
          "end": 204.62,
          "en": "and just ask get static props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204.62,
          "end": 206.5,
          "en": "That's a function which you can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.5,
          "end": 209.79,
          "en": "to your page component files and only there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.79,
          "end": 212.56,
          "en": "So not in any other component files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.56,
          "end": 217.23,
          "en": "and you need to export it to make Next.js aware of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 217.23,
          "end": 220.9,
          "en": "And now let's explore how this function works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.9,
          "end": 222.063,
          "en": "and how we use it.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
